            <note corresp="#d139-f6" n="6" xml:id="d139-f6-content">
                <p>In a letter dated January 31, Dulles replied: “I have your letter of January
                    26th. Thank you for the additional information about SUNFED. I am looking into
                    the matter raised by Cabot in the telegram you mention.” (Department of State, E
                    Files: Lot 60 D 68, International Development Fund, 1950–1957, W.J.
                    Stibravy)</p>
